From 89e48a3578756cb4a971385a266a18d0cef7988f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:23:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] RendererVAAPIGLES: the planes and the colour of a picture for
 the bridge are made in one place

RenderHdr10Tunnel() was a copy of RenderPlainMapping(), 45 lines: the layout
of the VAAPI surface, its size, the place of its chroma, its two textures, and
the colour of a picture drawn as it is (transfer, range, HDR10 metadata).
RenderDVConversion() had the first half of it too. They are now PlanesOf()
and PlainColourOf(), and the three functions take what they need from them;
what each gives the window is unchanged.

Tested on the host: the three functions, taken from the file as they are,
before and after, over 20000 pseudo-random states (layouts the bridge takes
and others, sizes, planes, chroma, transfer, range, HDR10 metadata with and
without denominators, no GBM window), 9284 calls of each reaching the window:
the window is given the same, field by field (the output of both is the same
to the byte). Three changed copies (MaxFALL taken for MaxCLL, one plane, the
chroma left out) give another output.
---
 .../HwDecRender/RendererVAAPIGLES.cpp         | 152 ++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 71 insertions(+), 81 deletions(-)

diff --git a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoRenderers/HwDecRender/RendererVAAPIGLES.cpp b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoRenderers/HwDecRender/RendererVAAPIGLES.cpp
index 35c94bd..5f6ca8a 100644
--- a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoRenderers/HwDecRender/RendererVAAPIGLES.cpp
+++ b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoRenderers/HwDecRender/RendererVAAPIGLES.cpp
@@ -250,66 +250,24 @@ bool CRendererVAAPIGLES::CanConvertDV(const VideoPicture& picture) const
